envFrom(Buld Injection)

envFrom:
  - secretRef:
      name: db-secret
This injects All keys from the secret as environmental variable


Example Secret:

data:
  DB_USER: YWRtaW4=
  DB_PASS: cGFzc3dvcmQ=

When to use envFrom: 

*You trust all keys
*YOu want simplicity
*Small project / quick setup

Problem 
*NO control over individual variable
*Easy to accidentally expose more than needed


valueFrom(Selective Injection)

env:
  - name: DB_USER
    valueFrom:
      secretKeyRef:
        name: db-secret
        key: DB_USER



When to use ValueFrom
*YOu want explicit control
*YOu follow productiong-grade practice
*YOu avoid accidental leaks


Why this is better 
* Only inject what is needed
* Clear mapping -> easier debuggin 
* Safer when secrets grow


